<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Mexico's Sanluis upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mexico's Sanluis upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interacciones brokerage said Wednesday it was upgrading Mexican conglomerate Corporacion Sanluis to buy from hold.</p>
<p>&quot;We are taking the opportunity to upgrade our investment opinion of Sanluis from a hold to a buy, believing that operating improvements, new contracts and recent underperformance all suggest that the company will outperform in the coming 12 months,&quot; analyst Robert E. Hulme said.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 7287902))</p>
</text>
